WEBVTT

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.750
It's the Nubilum.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.750
The Nubilum has reached
the Prometheus 1!

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:39.830
93 seconds until the Nebula arrives.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.790
Emergency instructions from Shinjuku!

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.500
Please ignore them.

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.330
The Nubilum's output is increasing!

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:01.870
S.O.S. kikoeta

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:06.830
Yatto anata ni kikoeta?

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:22.830
Kakko kawaiku ne

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.330
Fujun, junsui, dotchi no character?

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:29.200
Onaji na no kashira

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:31.700
Love beat ga sokudo zenkai

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:36.750
Kizuita, kore wa tokubetsu na mission... Wakatta

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:43.120
Honki misechau yo, kanaechau kara

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:47.000
Sora o tsukinuketa sekai de

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:53.950
Fushigi na omoi kanjita yo, shunkan de suki!

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:59.000
Egao de katsu desho, yappa egao wa tadashii no

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.370
Egao de katsu desho, yappa egao wa tadashii no

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:07.910
Naiteta chiisa na watashi ga tachimukau

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:10.250
Nandaro doki doki, chotto teate ga hitsuyou ne

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:13.580
Nandaro doki doki, chotto teate ga hitsuyou ne

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:21.620
Binetsu na kibun wa anata no sei kamo, S.O.S.!

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:35.910
An iDOL Master

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:44.500
Chihaya! What should I do?

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:58.540
The Imber is in Hold mode!

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:01.000
35 seconds till the Nebula arrives.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:14.040
Ow... What? What is this?

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:31.450
Chihaya!

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:35.870
That's...!

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:57.580
The Nebula has arrived.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:58.950
Yes!

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.160
Yeesh. SO uncool.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:13.500
Wait!

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:26.450
Chihaya! Let's go home already!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:31.120
If we keep at it, Mama will scold us
for playing around too much!

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:10.500
The Nubilum has moved
out of coverage range.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:11.830
Tally lights are off.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.040
Now retrieving the Imber and
the Nebula via Channel 13.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:17.700
Turiavita is being quite forceful.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.500
Incidentally, what is
the Idolmaster's condition?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.450
Still confirming.

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:26.370
Sir, it's President Yoshinaga
from the Shinjuku Branch.

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:28.160
Joseph.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:29.370
Well, well.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:31.370
Just what is going on?

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:35.620
I'm being flooded with inquiries from the
general public to the Self-Defense Forces!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.700
I'm terribly sorry.

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:39.580
There was a training accident....

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:40.540
Again? I've told you not to hold exercises
so close to residential areas.
There was a training accident....

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:41.830
Again? I've told you not to hold exercises
so close to residential areas.
We're still investigating the details.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:42.620
Again? I've told you not to hold exercises
so close to residential areas.
If you'll excuse me.

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:43.870
Hey, dammit!

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.660
He looked pretty angry.

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:50.660
If we said we'd really gone up
against a rival organization,

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.000
he'd burst a blood vessel.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.580
Miss Naze.

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:54.540
Sir?

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.870
The incident report, please.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.750
Huh? ME?!

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:14.370
Stand by in your room upon returning.
Mother will have words for you later.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:19.370
Will I get in trouble? Jeez!
This is Chihaya's fault!

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.290
Where am I?

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.250
A penguin?!

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.250
You're awake?

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.250
Okay, let's go!

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:51.540
I'd decided the moment I laid eyes on you.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:04.790
Hello?

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.700
Haruka? Haruka?!

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:09.040
Yayoi?

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.160
You're so cruel!

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:19.410
MOVERS

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:15.250
You haven't contacted me at all!
And you haven't answered your phone.

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:18.120
Huh? Oh. Sorry.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.410
Where are you?

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:23.700
Uh... Well, it's-

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:28.830
This is a doctor's office.
Cell phones aren't allowed.

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:30.410
Huh?

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:35.450
Haruka? Haruka! Agh, again?!

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:38.040
U-um...

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:40.080
Just where...

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:42.580
Am I?

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:45.410
And now, your chest.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:46.410
Yes, Ma'am.

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.410
Pink.

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:52.790
H-hey, what gives?!

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.580
All normal.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:58.200
U-um... Hey!

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:06.000
Such incredible power.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:09.950
The Prometheus 1, huh?
I know of it from documents, but...

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:12.790
It's the first time we've seen it in motion.

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:14.450
Rather fickle, isn't it?

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:18.160
Many mysteries yet remain
regarding the iDOLs.

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:24.330
What... do you intend to do with her?

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:29.080
The Imber has responded
simply by her being near.

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.330
It would seem her potential is clear.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.000
Indeed.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:35.290
Now then...

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.370
Is it true that Imber moved?

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:43.080
Yes, it's true.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.950
Who was it? Who moved it? Makoto?

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:48.410
Haruka Amami. A new girl.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:53.410
You can't just sit idly around. Either of you.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:55.250
I'm not.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:00.160
Haruka... Amami!

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.410
A p-pilot?!

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:08.830
Not a pilot: an Idolmaster.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:10.750
Idolmaster?

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.660
Are you fine with the Earl Grey?

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:15.000
Um, yes.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:18.250
Wait, just what is an Idolmaster?

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:22.000
An iDOL... master.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.580
iDOL master?

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:27.700
Huh?!

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:30.910
COMMUNITY CENTER
1st Idolmaster
Project
Audition
Meeting Hall

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.910
So, that audition was...!

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:35.000
Yes. An audition that we carried out
in utmost secrecy.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.620
Oh, no! I thought it was
a NORMAL idol audition!

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:40.290
Haruka Amami.

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:41.500
Ah! Yes?

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:44.200
You have an ability.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:49.200
Won't you use the Imber to save the world
from the threat of the konpeito?

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:52.950
Uh... Well...

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:55.500
You won't save it?

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:02.040
That's just fraud!

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:04.200
Yayoi, calm down.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:07.620
In any case, there's no way
you said okay, right?

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:12.620
But he was, like, really insistent.
Rather, sort of scary...

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:13.950
That won't do!

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:16.620
He's just some wicked swindler, right?!

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.120
"Wicked swindler"?

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:19.700
Yes!

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:23.450
You're a young girl new to Tokyo,
and his hungry eyes are on you!

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.870
R-really?!

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.500
There are a lot of his type in Tokyo.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:29.040
The boss at my agency said so, too.
That I should be careful.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:31.040
Um, Miss, we don't allow cosplay here...
The boss at my agency said so, too.
That I should be careful.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.620
Um, Miss, we don't allow cosplay here...
But... There's a robot...

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:34.450
Don't you worry!

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:36.080
As somewhat of a celebrity myself,

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:40.750
I, Yayoi Takatsuki, will be sure
to turn them in to the police!

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:42.200
Yayoi, the police is going a bit far...

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.950
Um, Miss?
Yayoi, the police is going a bit far...

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.580
Let's go bust into their offices right now!

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:51.000
Huh? Th-their offices?

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:51.750
Um...

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.200
Okay. This is it, huh?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:58.870
GYOKUTO
HIGH
SCHOOL

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:58.870
Um, Gyokuto... High School...

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:01.580
Hey! This is a high school!

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:02.910
Yes.

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:07.080
I see. They're using this as a front, huh?

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:11.290
Wicked swindlers are
quite elaborate these days.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:15.540
Yayoi! It'd be easier to run
if you took off your suit!

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:17.370
Haruka, hurry up!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:34.160
You're Haruka Amami?

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:38.000
Y-yes...

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.830
Don't get full of yourself.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.450
You can't handle Imber!

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:47.330
Imber?

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:10.250
Ooh, a little scary...

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:27.330
Ah! It's Karasu!

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:33.040
Look! It's Mama! See, look!

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:35.660
That's a good drawing. It looks like her.

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:40.120
Give this to Mama. Tell her I'm sorry.

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:42.160
Okay.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:46.870
Karasu.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.250
What did Mother say?

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.410
There'll be no censure for this failure.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:56.620
However, you shouldn't leave
for the time being.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:58.620
I see.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:02.540
It's like it's abandoned...

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:05.910
This is the perfect place for a hiding spot.

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:08.540
I think this was the classroom...

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:15.200
It's locked.

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:18.370
I've got it. They've already fled from here!

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:19.290
Huh?

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:21.450
It happens a lot.

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:25.160
Okay, let's go check the dorms.
There may be a clue.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:26.790
Ah, wait!

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:29.370
Hello?

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:31.580
I'm in the middle of...

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:36.450
That's the time already?
Understood! I'll go right now!

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:38.950
Sorry, I have to go to the radio station.

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:45.200
Wait for me at my apartment.
We'll go to the dorm together tomorrow.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.540
Okay.

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:47.450
Bye!

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:48.540
Good luck!

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:49.950
Thank you!

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:53.290
Yayoi sure is busy.

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:57.950
Still, Yayoi's apartment is...

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:06.790
Which way did she go?

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.500
Haruka.

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:11.250
Yukiho!

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:14.080
Thank goodness.
This is where you've been.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:17.000
Yukiho! You're all right!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.040
Yes.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:22.660
Good thing, huh? This one's been
worried about you the whole time.

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:24.750
Uh... Um...

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:28.410
I'm Ritsuko Akizuki. I'm here to get you.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.200
Huh?

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:32.870
Oh.

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:38.870
So, he wasn't a wicked swindler.
He really wanted me to be a robot pilot.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:43.950
The boss's explanations aren't that good.
He leaves out the important stuff.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:46.250
Wh-what should we do?

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:48.830
I decided to try and see.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:50.370
Huh? Huh?!

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:52.790
Is that strange?

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:57.620
I mean, it's being a robot pilot! They're
super big! They, like, creak and stuff!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.000
Don't make noise while we're eating.
I mean, it's being a robot pilot! They're
super big! They, like, creak and stuff!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:05.790
Yes, but, I went to the audition hoping
to find another aspect of myself,

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:08.290
rather than to become a celebrity...

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:10.910
But, but...! They fly up in the air!

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.830
I like heights.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:15.250
You might have to go
to space or something!

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:17.290
I think I'd like to see that.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:21.540
Are you going to say no, Haruka?

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:22.660
W-well...

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:24.040
I heard.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:26.160
You rode one, didn't you?

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:32.950
I didn't ride it! It just sort of happened.
Kind of like... Anyway!

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.580
Hey, you're asleep!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:39.410
Even if it "sort of happened,"
the fact it let you in is amazing!

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:44.580
Even with proper training,
there's no guarantee it'll let you in.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.250
It seems to really like you.

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:49.160
"Like me"? It's a robot.

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:51.080
But it has a heart.

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:52.540
A heart?

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:55.870
At least, that's what I think.

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:59.000
I mean, they're so cute!

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:05.750
This is Yayoi Takatsuki's "Yayoi-style Radio"!

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:07.790
Good evening, ya-yoi-yo!

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:09.620
I'm everyone's fave idol, Yayoi Takatsuki.

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:10.290
Japan's meteorite-eliminating machines
that are the envy of the world: the iDOLs.

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:13.450
Japan's meteorite-eliminating machines
that are the envy of the world: the iDOLs.
It's the middle of spring, and sure is hot, huh?

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.620
Japan's meteorite-eliminating machines
that are the envy of the world: the iDOLs.
Are the cherry blossoms out in your hometown?

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:15.910
Are the cherry blossoms out in your hometown?

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.910
So strong!
Our Nebula
won't lose to
some Drop!!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.620
It ain't cute!

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:27.620
Why is everyone so serious about it?

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:29.700
You can't handle the Imber!

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:31.500
I mean, they're so cute!

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:42.040
The Cream Belt and Sugar Belt are clear.

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:45.250
We've concluded our announcement
to Mondenkind China.

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:46.870
Now beginning the countdown:

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:51.540
Five, four, three, two, one.

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:53.040
Work is complete.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.000
Good job.

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:08.500
Ma'am?

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:09.500
What?

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.370
This.

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:12.250
What should we do?

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:15.700
May we invite her?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:17.500
Of course.

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.620
What should I do?

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:54.790
Excuse me...

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:01.330
Wh-what?!

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:11.620
What is this?

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:28.830
The Imber?

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:38.790
It's so big.

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:41.410
You interested, maybe?

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:48.080
I'm Azusa Miura. Head of the iDOL team.
Nice to meet you.

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:50.450
Um, yeah...

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:53.200
What do you think?

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:58.290
It's big. And kind of scary.

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:01.330
I'm disappointed to hear you say that.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:03.790
The Imber...

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:07.290
It came out just to meet you.

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:10.830
To... meet me?

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:12.910
Do you have the Eye?

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:19.000
That is the one way to get to know them.

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:29.410
Just what is going on?!

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:46.000
Maybe it wants to say hello.

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.120
What do you think?

00:19:58.080 --> 00:20:00.580
Izayoi
Dorm

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:03.950
There.

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:05.200
If you don't mind!

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:07.500
Yes?

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:12.000
Oh. What a cute penguin-

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:23.200
Where's Haruka?! Tell me!

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:27.580
I know that you all took her!
Now hurry up and-

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:28.700
Yayoi.

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:31.830
Haruka!

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:33.750
Haruka, are you... all...

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.500
What's with that uniform?

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:40.450
It's a school uniform.

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:44.450
I know that! Have they dressed you
in that to do some shady job?

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:47.750
No. I had the wrong idea.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:48.540
Wrong idea?

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:52.500
Yeah. It looks like the audition
I went to wasn't to be an idol.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:54.410
It was a school entrance exam.

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:56.120
School?

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:58.450
I have to be going now.

00:20:58.450 --> 00:20:59.870
Huh?

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:02.290
Um...

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:04.120
Hello?

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:07.250
See you!

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:08.790
Hey, hey-!

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:11.370
Haruka!

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.790
So soft...

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:15.660
Haruka.

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:17.620
Oh, Yukiho. Good morning!

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:21.830
Is it really all right?

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:25.580
Um, I don't want to worry Yayoi.

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:30.290
If she knew there's a base there,
it would cause all kinds of trouble.

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:34.290
That's not what I meant. Are you really
going to be an Idolmaster?

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:37.950
Um, I don't quite get it, but...

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:39.330
"But"?

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:41.410
Well, whatever!

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:45.040
Okay.

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:46.580
Let's go.

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:47.950
Wait, Haruka!

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:50.250
Please don't pull me like that!

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:52.410
GINZA
SORAYA

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:52.120
Hurry, hurry!

00:21:56.370 --> 00:22:05.330
Toki o wataru seija no you ni

00:22:05.330 --> 00:22:14.290
Donna kodoku ni naite ita no?

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:23.160
Haruka tooi hoshi o tsunagi

00:22:23.160 --> 00:22:31.700
Ne, omoi o egaku wa, sora o miagete

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:43.160
Dear boy, itsumo kokoro ni anata o sagaseba

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:52.120
Ah, dakishimeru hodo ni tsuyoi hikari o hanatsu no

00:22:52.120 --> 00:23:01.080
Mabataku kidou ga futari no mejirushi

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:12.700
Ima doko de mite ite mo truth kanjitete

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:41.040
Preview
iDOL and Master

00:23:26.830 --> 00:23:29.540
Yukiho, what do you do on your days off?

00:23:29.540 --> 00:23:30.750
I sleep.

00:23:30.750 --> 00:23:32.000
And in your free time?

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:33.120
I sleep.

00:23:33.120 --> 00:23:33.700
Well then-

00:23:33.700 --> 00:23:34.790
I sleep.
Well then-

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:36.830
Yukiho...

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:38.330
Let's sleep.

00:23:39.500 --> 00:23:40.620
Okay.
